                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4057d84-3bea-48b4-8c0a-d88957815d16",
                                "sense_id": "25d3f501-8d05-3c91-a72d-ebdace2a9639",
                                "text": "Come old mutton mongerer, despatch! despatch!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be1b0535-bd56-4f82-9855-f1b2ff29655f",
                                "sense_id": "25d3f501-8d05-3c91-a72d-ebdace2a9639",
                                "text": "Monkfish, the poor man's lobster, according to my fish mongerer, tasted very similar to lobster almost better in my eyes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "edac99dd-d082-3ba0-a9ff-2a57b98048e0",
                        "entry_id": "5866dd12-c1e7-3f43-b12a-6fd714eb18b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of monger.",
                            "One who promotes something undesirable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "proscribed"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "528f0b86-23e0-4b60-9866-491263b80acb",
                                "sense_id": "edac99dd-d082-3ba0-a9ff-2a57b98048e0",
                                "text": "What is wanted primarily, shall I say, in the teacher, is that he be a man or that she be a woman, not a method mongerer.[…] By method is meant the law of the mind’s movement. This is a narrower field than that of psychology and even more fruitful of suggestion to the teacher."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "645a035c-0a6c-4287-a2f2-260e87234689",
                                "sense_id": "edac99dd-d082-3ba0-a9ff-2a57b98048e0",
                                "text": "He was also an orator of no mean ability. He was not a phrase mongerer, but a man of ideas, and capable of presenting them in a clear and concise manner."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d4353d4-ad6d-4532-9f3a-1ff525f4fb7b",
                                "sense_id": "edac99dd-d082-3ba0-a9ff-2a57b98048e0",
                                "text": "Are you entertaining whores with my gelt? Is my nephew a mongerer of whores?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
